282
00:17:17,381 --> 00:17:25,380
The amount of material on this vehicle is capable of covering approximately a football field with the anti-traction material.

283
00:17:26,660 --> 00:17:33,020
The moment this van tries to traverse the sprayed area, the driver immediately has trouble continuing forward.

284
00:17:33,620 --> 00:17:39,960
As the tires spin, the material adheres to them, assuring no friction between the tires and the concrete road surface.

285
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:46,120
It makes no difference if it's a rear-wheel drive, front-wheel drive, four-wheel drive vehicle.

286
00:17:46,121 --> 00:17:52,940
It's equally effective on all type of rubber-tyed vehicles on a concrete or asphalt surface.

287
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:03,360
Some strange, less-than-lethal weapons take aim at one or more of the senses.

