00:18:27,861 --> 00:18:30,940
and if you're in an enclosed area, you get a complete envelopment,

295
00:18:30,941 --> 00:18:34,000
and you get almost immediate compliance.

296
00:18:37,580 --> 00:18:40,780
Sometimes a very bright light is enough to do the job.

