305
00:19:07,281 --> 00:19:12,280
And this technology consists of a bright set of LED technology,

306
00:19:12,380 --> 00:19:16,280
light-emitting diodes, that is designed to create

307
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:20,820
a sort of temporary blindness, meaning temporary ability

308
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:25,260
to not be able to see the person who we're trying to protect.

