00:19:51,241 --> 00:19:53,560
can induce psychophysical effects,

318
00:19:54,020 --> 00:19:56,140
including vertigo and possible nausea.

319
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:58,560
It's been nicknamed the puke light.

320
00:19:59,140 --> 00:20:01,820
This provides what we call an exploitation,

321
00:20:01,821 --> 00:20:06,220
the moment in time in which the individual is disoriented, dizzy,

322
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:08,540
a little bit of vertigo has been affected on the person,

323
00:20:08,780 --> 00:20:12,020
and that allows us to be able to grab his limbs and arms and see his hands

