00:20:12,021 --> 00:20:14,180
and take him into custody safely.

325
00:20:14,700 --> 00:20:18,760
Law enforcement agencies are hoping the puke light will pass its final field tests.

326
00:20:19,820 --> 00:20:23,040
In the meantime, they're already using another non-lethal weapon

