00:21:01,520 --> 00:21:09,060
This device has six speakers in it, and it sends its information out in a parallel beams of five degrees.

341
00:21:09,840 --> 00:21:13,120
Conventional technology sends its information out conically,

342
00:21:13,320 --> 00:21:17,380
which dissipates very quickly and cannot be understood at long distances.

343
00:21:18,080 --> 00:21:23,580
When using our device in foreign countries, it may be necessary to speak foreign languages,

344
00:21:23,581 --> 00:21:27,480
and the phrasolator, which is a product that we use in conjunction with our speakers,

345
00:21:27,620 --> 00:21:29,260
allows us to do just that.

346
00:21:32,360 --> 00:21:33,520
That was Arabic.

347
00:21:34,420 --> 00:21:36,100
If the verbal warnings aren't heated,

348
00:21:36,800 --> 00:21:42,940
sounds like sirens, machine guns, and barking dogs

