00:21:42,941 --> 00:21:46,900
may make those targeted reconsider.

350
00:21:47,760 --> 00:21:52,040
If they don't, it's time to turn on the wobble sound and crank up the volume.

351
00:21:53,580 --> 00:21:56,320
From a non-lethal weapon standpoint,

352
00:21:56,420 --> 00:21:59,180
our piercing, what we call our wobble tone,

353
00:21:59,280 --> 00:22:02,820
it has definitely the capability of forcing you

354
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:05,720
to put your fingers in your ears to try and slow down

355
00:22:05,820 --> 00:22:08,820
that pain that you're feeling in your head.

356
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:12,160
For a sudden attack on the senses of both sight and sound,

