390
00:23:58,021 --> 00:24:02,140
With the corner shop, you can pie around a corridor

391
00:24:02,141 --> 00:24:05,100
without exposing yourself.

392
00:24:05,101 --> 00:24:08,020
If you need to straighten up, it straightens up very quickly

