398
00:24:22,701 --> 00:24:26,740
like walls, doors, barricades, or to aim under vehicles.

399
00:24:29,780 --> 00:24:32,460
Looking here at the business end of the corner shot,

400
00:24:32,461 --> 00:24:37,420
we have the camera, the flashlight, the red laser,

401
00:24:37,421 --> 00:24:41,300
the infrared laser, and of course, not forgetting the gun.

402
00:24:41,301 --> 00:24:43,020
The video from the camera is displayed

403
00:24:43,021 --> 00:24:46,800
on the gun's monitor and is not only used for targeting,

404
00:24:47,360 --> 00:24:48,720
but also for surveillance.

405
00:24:49,420 --> 00:24:53,320
The corner shot is actually in use by many special forces

406
00:24:53,321 --> 00:24:55,860
