410
00:25:08,860 --> 00:25:10,900
but to hide or disguise the weapon itself.

411
00:25:10,901 --> 00:25:20,440
In the old days, people would commonly bring a knife and fork set because they didn't give you silverware in restaurants or at most dinner parties.

412
00:25:20,920 --> 00:25:24,380
These had concealed guns in the back.

413
00:25:24,960 --> 00:25:27,360
They're very finely silver inlaid into ivory.

414
00:25:27,760 --> 00:25:31,160
And these are a period of about 1670 to 1700.

415
00:25:31,860 --> 00:25:37,940
They are fired by a drop-down trigger mechanism, which came out of the body.

416
00:25:37,941 --> 00:25:42,840
Another example of a concealed weapon is a cane gun.

417
00:25:43,340 --> 00:25:44,680
This is a day's patent.

418
00:25:45,280 --> 00:25:48,800
It was made in the 1850s and was cocked

419
00:25:48,801 --> 00:25:51,580
so that it could be fired with the trigger

420
00:25:51,581 --> 00:25:53,900
