432
00:26:37,940 --> 00:26:42,780
There is a rotary magazine within the body of the pistol,

433
00:26:43,000 --> 00:26:44,560
which revolves when squeezed,

434
00:26:44,900 --> 00:26:49,100
and there is seven shots within this wheel-like magazine.

435
00:26:50,280 --> 00:26:53,040
Palm pistols have also been called assassin's pistols.

436
00:26:54,120 --> 00:26:56,600
An apparent handshake could be a deadly encounter.

