00:27:29,700 --> 00:27:32,680
It's a 27-pound weapon as it sits right here.

446
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:36,100
To help avoid giving away his position,

447
00:27:36,101 --> 00:27:41,380
A sniper using this ballistic beast can screw a suppressor onto the end of the barrel.

